`@powerhousedao/shared/document-drive` currently publishes no `types` condition in its `exports` map. Under `"moduleResolution": "nodenext"` TypeScript reports `TS2307: Cannot find module '@powerhousedao/shared/document-drive'` even though the import works at runtime. Until that is fixed, set `"moduleResolution": "bundler"`, or add a local `declare module` shim for the symbols you use.
